# ── DISCOVERY-DAILY LANE (BH-9795) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Daily 07:23 UTC: bin/discovery-daily.sh <project> reads the project's
# discovery sources (part 1: Sentry), drops known items in code, makes one
# no-tools model call per remaining item, and a rules table in code files an
# ai-build ticket, comments on an open candidate ticket, or marks noise. It
# runs on the hub: SENTRY_API_TOKEN and the Telegram token are hub env. One
# line per project that has the lane on (settings row
# lane.discovery-daily.<project>.discovery_sources). The hub lease gates it.
# Off: flags/lane-off-discovery-daily, or bin/harness-ctl.sh off discovery-daily.
# Doc: docs/DISCOVERY-DAILY.md.
# @hub-lanes
23 7 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/discovery-daily.sh project-6-os >> /root/harness/logs/discovery-daily.log 2>&1
